                "description": "Choose from either flat black or medium bronze finishes for this Classic Bronze Single Cylinder Deadbolt. A single cylinder deadbolt, the Classic Tuscany Bronze Deadbolt is locked and unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside. The Classic Single Cylinder Lost Wax Bronze Deadbolt is made with Mediterranean Home Decor in made, with a strong influence from the old world.",
